menu "ESP Base"

    config ESP_BASE_TEST_NO_BROKER
        bool "Test build only: never connect to the MQTT broker"
        default n
        help
            The firmware joins Wi-Fi but never connects to the broker, so it is never
            confirmed and the bootloader rolls back after the 300 s window. Used only to
            verify automatic rollback; release packaging refuses images built with it.

    choice ESP_BASE_TEST_BUSINESS
        prompt "Test build only: built-in business layer that misbehaves"
        default ESP_BASE_TEST_BUSINESS_NONE
        help
            Makes the base firmware (apps/esp_base) carry a business layer named test_fault that
            misbehaves 20 s after every boot. Used only to verify the business watchdog and safe
            mode on a real board; release packaging refuses images built with it.

        config ESP_BASE_TEST_BUSINESS_NONE
            bool "none"
        config ESP_BASE_TEST_BUSINESS_PANIC
            bool "abort() 20 s after boot"
        config ESP_BASE_TEST_BUSINESS_HANG
            bool "stop feeding the business watchdog 20 s after boot"
    endchoice

endmenu
